{"id":"4a0cf017-de84-f111-ab0f-7c1e5266a11f","fromAddress":"supportmail@techsupport.microsoft.com","subject":"Kubernetes Gateway API - TrackingID#2607210030004076","createdDate":"2026-07-21T08:28:08Z","updatedDate":"2026-07-21T08:28:13Z","body":"<div class=\"ck-content\" data-wrapper=\"true\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--ck-image-style-spacing: 1.5em; --ck-inline-image-style-spacing: calc(var(--ck-image-style-spacing) / 2); font-family: Segoe UI; font-size: 11pt;\"><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">안녕하세요.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">마이크로소프트 Azure 기술지원에 문의해 주셔서 감사합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">본 케이스를 지원하게 된 마이크로소프트 AKS 기술지원팀 백도운 입니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">먼저, 유선으로 통화가 필요할 경우가 존재하여 아래와 사항을 사전에 안내 드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">한국마이크로소프트는 산업안전보건법에 따른 고객 응대근로자 보호조치를 따르고 있습니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">엔지니어가 고객께 전화를 드릴 때 수신번호 1577-9700 으로 표시되며,</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">상담 내용은 고객지원 및 서비스 개선 등을 위해 녹음 되며, 관련 법안에 따라 일정기간 보관됩니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">문의사항을 다음과 같이 정리하여 전달드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">내용을 살펴보시고 문의사항 있으시면 언제든지 연락 부탁드립니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">[문의 사항]</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">대상: /subscriptions/6ccc8d33-f6cb-48dc-95e1-33ad9eb4de8d/resourceGroups/rg-az01-og057901-dev-ris-01/providers/Microsoft.ContainerService/managedClusters/aks-az01-dev-ris-01</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">문의사항:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">App Routing Add-on (Managed NGINX) 26년11월까지 지원종료 예정을 확인되어 App Routing Gateway API 전환을 준비중에 있습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">아래와 같이 ingress 내 annotation을 적용 운영중에 있습니다. Gateway API 설정 시 아래의 annotation 설정이 가능한 영역인건지, 가이드 기술지원 요청 드리겠습니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp; </span>annotations:</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/affinity: cookie</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/proxy-body-size:</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/session-cookie-name: route</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-ciphers:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-protocols:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>nginx.ingress.kubernetes.io/ssl-redirect:&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" lang=\"ko\">[확인</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" lang=\"ko\">사항]</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"ko\">문의주신</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> ingress-nginx&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">에서</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">사용되던</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> annotations&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">들은</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">현재</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> app routing gateway api</span><span lang=\"ko\">에서는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">사용이</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">불가한</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">상황입니다</span><span lang=\"en-US\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"ko\">기본적으로</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">아래와</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">같은</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> crd</span><span lang=\"ko\">들만</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">제공되고</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">있으며</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\" lang=\"en-US\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">```</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">gatewayclasses.gateway.networking.k8s.io<span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span>2025-08-29T17:52:36Z</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">gateways.gateway.networking.k8s.io<span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2025-08-29T17:52:36Z</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">grpcroutes.gateway.networking.k8s.io<span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2025-08-29T17:52:36Z</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">httproutes.gateway.networking.k8s.io<span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2025-08-29T17:52:37Z</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">referencegrants.gateway.networking.k8s.io<span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span>2025-08-29T17:52:37Z</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\" lang=\"en-US\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">```</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/managed-gateway-api#verify-managed-gateway-api-crd-installation\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/aks/managed-gateway-api#verify-managed-gateway-api-crd-installation</span></a></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"ko\">실제</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">공유해주신</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> annotation</span><span lang=\"ko\">에</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">부합되는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">설정을</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">위해서는</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> envoyfilter</span><span lang=\"ko\">나</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">DestinationRule</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">같은</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> crd</span><span lang=\"ko\">가</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">필요하여</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"ko\">이로</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">인해</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> annotation</span><span lang=\"ko\">이</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">매칭되는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">기능을</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">사용할수는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">없는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">상황입니다</span><span lang=\"en-US\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\" lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"ko\">다만</span><span lang=\"en-US\">,&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">마지막으로</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">추가해주신</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> ssl-redirect</span><span lang=\"ko\">의</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">경우는</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">아래</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">소개된</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> httproute&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">에</span><span lang=\"en-US\"> requestredirect filter type</span><span lang=\"ko\">을</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">통해</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">구현이</span><span lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"ko\">가능해보입니다</span><span lang=\"en-US\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><a href=\"https://gateway-api.sigs.k8s.io/guides/user-guides/http-redirect-rewrite/#redirects\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">https://gateway-api.sigs.k8s.io/guides/user-guides/http-redirect-rewrite/#redirects</span></a></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\" lang=\"en-US\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">추가 문의사항이 있으시면&nbsp;언제든지 저에게 알려주시고,&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">회신시에는 반드시 \"전체 회신\" 으로 해 주시기를 요청 드립니다. &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10.0pt;\">감사합니다.</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"direction:ltr;\"><div id=\"signature\"><div><div style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\" data-wrapper=\"true\"><div><div style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI','Helvetica Neue',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;\" data-wrapper=\"true\"><div><span style=\"color:#0071c2;font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><strong>백도운, Doun Baek</strong></span><br><span style=\"color:#0071c2;font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><strong>Azure Containers </strong></span></span><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">| Support Escalation Engineer</span></span><br><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Microsoft Korea | Office: +82 (2) 531-8172 | E-mail: </span></span><a href=\"mailto:jacobbaek@microsoft.com\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">jacobbaek@microsoft.com</span></span></a><br><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Working hours: Mon-Fri 9:00 am - 6:00 pm (Korea, GMT+9)</span></span><br><a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fazure.microsoft.com%2Fko-kr%2Fsupport%2Fplans%2F&amp;data=05%7C01%7Cjacobbaek%40microsoft.com%7C3db015cbf68b41b4599f08da849f8815%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637968117969488888%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=bWGRQ1%2F9oB811bOlhycfVsccduiPhEVYFLR1yucVbSs%3D&amp;reserved=0\"><span style=\"color:#0563c1;font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Azure </span>기술 지원 플랜 비교</span></a><span style=\"font-family:굴림;font-size:10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> | </span></span><a href=\"https://